   "title": "Hyundai Motor, Kia's combined China sales fall below 10,000 units in Sept.",
   "url": "https://www.koreatimes.co.kr/business/companies/20261025/hyundai-motor-kias-combined-china-sales-fall-below-10000-units-in-sept",
