   "title": "FDA destroys 564 litres of milk in Mumbai; statewide crackdown nets food stock worth ₹1.56 crore",
   "url": "https://www.thehindu.com/news/cities/mumbai/fda-destroys-564-litres-of-milk-in-mumbai-statewide-crackdown-nets-food-stock-worth-156-crore/article71622655.ece",
