   "title": "Abia LP Campaign Media Directorate Vows To Deliver For Otti’s Re-Election",
   "url": "https://leadership.ng/abia-lp-campaign-media-directorate-vows-to-deliver-for-ottis-re-election/",
   "domain": "leadership.ng",
   "source": "Leadership（尼日利亚）",
   "published": "Sun, 25 Oct 2026 08:16:11 +0000",
   "_dt": 1792916171.0,
   "ageDays": 0.02,
   "summary": "Ememanka, however, said the directorate would not relent in its efforts, despite what he described as widespread public knowledge of the transformation taking place in the state under Otti’s administration. He said another advantage was that the directorate was campaigning for the re-election of a governor who, in his view, had demystified governance.",
   "summary_zh": "然而，埃梅曼卡表示，尽管他所描述的公众广泛知晓州政府在奥蒂领导下正在发生的转变，该局不会放松努力。他说另一个优势是该局正在为一位州长的连任进行竞选活动，在他看来，这位州长已经揭开了治理的神秘面纱。",
   "summarySource": "fulltext",
   "body": "Ememanka, who is also the Director-General of the State Strategic Communications Bureau, gave the assurance while speaking with LEADERSHIP Sunday in Umuahia, the state capital. He attributed the task to the achievements of Governor Alex Otti’s administration across various sectors of the state’s economy in less than four years in office. According to him, the governor’s projects across the 17 local government areas in education, healthcare and road infrastructure, among other sectors, as well as his insistence on merit in appointments, demonstrate the administration’s performance. “His developmental projects across the 17 local government areas in education, healthcare, and road infrastructure among others and his insistence on merit in his appointments, speak volumes,” he said. Ememanka, however, said the directorate would not relent in its efforts, despite what he described as widespread public knowledge of the transformation taking place in the state under Otti’s administration. He said another advantage was that the directorate was campaigning for the re-election of a governor who, in his view, had demystified governance. The media director also dismissed opposition claims that the Otti administration lacked transparency, insisting that public funds were being properly managed to provide social amenities for residents. The legal practitioner maintained that the state had not experienced such progress before the emergence of the current administration and expressed optimism that residents would enjoy better days ahead under Otti. We’ve got the edge. Get real-time reports, breaking scoops, and exclusive angles delivered straight to your phone. Don’t settle for stale news. Join LEADERSHIP NEWS on WhatsApp for 24/7 updates →",
