   "title": "Stalin calls on DMK cadres to prepare to oust TVK-led government soon in Tamil Nadu",
   "url": "https://www.thehindu.com/news/national/tamil-nadu/stalin-calls-on-dmk-cadres-to-prepare-to-oust-tvk-led-government-soon-in-tamil-nadu/article71622737.ece",
   "domain": "thehindu.com",
   "source": "thehindu.com",
   "published": "Sun, 25 Oct 2026 13:34:16 +0530",
   "_dt": 1792915456.0,
   "ageDays": 0.03,
   "summary": "Stalin on Sunday (October 25, 2026) wondered whether the TVK-led government in Tamil Nadu, headed by Chief Minister C. Joseph Vijay, would last even six months and urged his party workers to be prepared to oust the government.",
   "summary_zh": "Stalin于星期日（2026年10月25日）质疑由首席部长C. Joseph Vijay领导的泰米尔纳德邦TVK政府能否维持哪怕6个月，并敦促本党工作人员做好罢黜该政府的准备。",
   "summarySource": "fulltext",
   "body": "Account subscription benefits alongside Premium Stories, Editorials, Opinions and more. Unlock these with Subscription DMK president M.K. Stalin on Sunday (October 25, 2026) wondered whether the TVK-led government in Tamil Nadu, headed by Chief Minister C. Joseph Vijay, would last even six months and urged his party workers to be prepared to oust the government. Speaking at a marriage function in Chennai, Mr. Stalin said when the DMK-led alliance won the 2021 Assembly election and he took charge as Chief Minister, he had told reporters that his government would deliver good governance that even those who had not voted for the alliance would regret not having voted for it. However, he said today, those who had voted for the TVK had been regretting their decision. “Under this government, newspapers carry reports every day of rising prices of essential commodities, administrative failures, sexual offences, murders and robberies. On one side, there are power cuts, while on the other, reports have been appearing for the past five or six days about children being kidnapped,” he said. He said the government had formed a special force called the Singappen Special Force . “Now, a situation has arisen in which another force has to be formed to protect the Singappen Special Force,” he said. Referring to Mr. Vijay’s rhetoric during the 2026 election campaign that the electoral battle was between only two parties — the TVK and the DMK — Mr. Stalin said after the TVK-led government came to power, the contest had become one between power cuts and murders. “But now, the situation has changed to a fight between sexual violence and the proliferation of narcotic drugs. Now, the people of Tamil Nadu must have clearly understood who the real evil force is,” Mr. Stalin said. “I had said this government would last only for six months. Now, the situation has reached a point whether this government would even last for six months,” Mr. Stalin said, urging DMK cadres to prepare to oust the government. Comments have to be in English, and in full sentences. They cannot be abusive or personal. Please abide by our community guidelines for posting your comments. We have migrated to a new commenting platform. If you are already a registered user of The Hindu and logged in, you may continue to engage with our articles. If you do not have an account please register and login to post comments. Users can access their older comments by logging into their accounts on Vuukle",
