   "title_zh": "Stalin敦促DMK干部为soon罢黜泰米尔纳德邦TVK领导的政府做好准备",
   "body_zh": "订阅账户还可享受《The Hindu》深度报道、社论、观点等更多内容。2026年10月25日（星期日），DMK主席M.K.斯大林解锁了这些内容，并想知道由首席部长C.约瑟夫·维杰领导、由TVK执政的泰米尔纳德邦政府能否维持哪怕六个月，同时敦促本党工作人员做好准备，将该政府赶下台。斯大林先生在金奈一场婚礼活动上表示，2021年地方议会选举中，由DMK领导的联盟获胜并由他出任首席部长后，他曾对记者表示，他的政府将提供良政善政，就连那些没有投票给该联盟的人也会后悔没有投票。然而，他表示，如今投票给TVK的人正在为他们的决定感到后悔。斯大林说：“在这届政府统治下，报纸每天都刊登生活必需品价格上涨、行政失职、性犯罪、谋杀和抢劫等报道。一边是停电，另一方面，过去五六天不断出现儿童遭绑架的报道。”他说，政府组建了一支名为Singappen Special Force的特别部队。“如今出现了这样一种局面：还得再组建一支力量来保护Singappen Special Force。”他 Referring to Mr. Vijay’s rhetoric during the 2026 election campaign that the electoral battle was between only two parties — the TVK and the DMK — Mr. Stalin said after the TVK-led government came to power, the contest had become one between power cuts and murders. “But now, the situation has changed to a fight between sexual violence and the proliferation of narcotic drugs. Now, the people of Tamil Nadu must have clearly understood who the real evil force is,” Mr. Stalin said. “I had said this government would last only for six months. Now, the situation has reached a point whether this government would even last for six months,” Mr. Stalin said, urging DMK cadres to prepare to oust the government. Comments have to be in English, and in full sentences. They cannot be abusive or personal. Please abide by our community guidelines for posting your comments. We have migrated to a new commenting platform. If you are already a registered user of The Hindu and logged in, you may continue to engage with our articles. If you do not have an account please register and login to post comments. Users can access their older comments by logging into their accounts on Vuukle"
