   "title": "Akasa Air launches daily direct flights between Visakhapatnam and Delhi",
   "url": "https://www.thehindu.com/news/cities/Visakhapatnam/akasa-air-launches-daily-direct-flights-between-visakhapatnam-and-delhi/article71619997.ece",
