   "summary": "Former President Barack Obama has attacked the Trump administration over the Iran war and high consumer prices as he hit the campaign trail for Democrats ahead of the US midterm elections. \"This election is our last best chance to at least rein in some of the foolishness of this administration,\" Obama told crowds in Ohio on Saturday. Meanwhile, US President Donald Trump touted his administration's immigration and tariff policies at a rally in Georgia, telling supporters \"we're in the golden age of America\".",
   "summary_zh": "在美国中期选举前为民主党人开展竞选活动时，前总统贝拉克·奥巴马抨击特朗普政府在伊朗战争和高消费者物价方面的表现。奥巴马周六在俄亥俄州对人群表示：“这次选举是我们遏制本届政府部分愚蠢行径的最后最佳机会。”与此同时，美国总统唐纳德·特朗普在佐治亚州的一场集会上宣传其政府的移民和关税政策，告诉支持者：“我们正处在美国的黄金时代。”",
   "summarySource": "index",
   "body": "Former President Barack Obama has attacked the Trump administration over the Iran war and high consumer prices as he hit the campaign trail for Democrats ahead of the US midterm elections. \"This election is our last best chance to at least rein in some of the foolishness of this administration,\" Obama told crowds in Ohio on Saturday. Meanwhile, US President Donald Trump touted his administration's immigration and tariff policies at a rally in Georgia, telling supporters \"we're in the golden age of America\". The midterm elections on 3 November will decide which party controls Congress for the rest of Trump's term, and therefore how easy it is for the president to carry out his plans",
