   "body": "SHENZHEN, China, Oct. 24, 2026 /PRNewswire/ — On October 22, Shenzhen World Exhibition & Convention Center was illuminated in a deep ocean blue as the 2026 China Marine Economy Expo—themed “Digital and Smart Ocean: Co-creating a Sustainable Future”—officially opened. Spanning an exhibition area of 50,000 square meters, the expo hosts over 350 enterprises and is expected […]",
