   "title": "No, petrol discounts at Nigeria’s state-owned filling stations do not mean fuel subsidies are back, finance minister says",
   "url": "https://africacheck.org/fact-checks/meta-programme-fact-checks/no-petrol-discounts-nigerias-state-owned-filling-stations-do",
   "domain": "africacheck.org",
