   "summary": "Senate Leader Opeyemi Bamidele says Lagos’ prosperity cannot be secured through isolated planning alone, urging a regional development compact with Southwe Read More: https://punchng.com/lagos-cant-prosper-through-isolated-planning-bamidele/",
