   "snippet": "The programme featured Nigeria Rising: Reformed, Resilient, Ready to Scale, a presentation on Nigeria’s reform agenda, macroeconomic progress and investment opportunities. A panel discussion followed, featuring perspectives from the CBN, Standard Bank Group, Flutterwave, Huawei’s Central Bank Business Unit and the China-Africa Fund for Industrial Cooperation.\n\nDiscussions focused on policy continuity and investor confidence, cross-border payments and local-currency settlement, and the role of financial innovation in supporting trade and investment. The presentation and panel connected Nigeria’s reform progress with the practical considerations of investors, financial institutions and businesses operating across both markets.",
