   "snippet": "Myanmar's first corporate HSK test center opened at Myanmar Wanbao Mining Copper Ltd. A total of 106 employees of the Monywa Copper Mine Project sat the inaugural HSK exam.\n\nCustomized workplace Chinese language training, jointly developed with Shandong Polytechnic College, helped learners prepare for the test. Many earned excellent scores, including full marks.\n\nIt is another success story of the \"Chinese +TVET\" initiative — a story of empowering local talent and supporting China-Myanmar industrial cooperation.\n\n#CLECInAction #HSK #ChinaMyanmarTies",
